#creator_desc
21289	sDoes medium damage and takes full damage, but can enter stealth, causing its next attack to do massive damage and ignore armor. However, it becomes briefly unable to recall after attacking from stealth.
21290	sMoves very fast, does medium damage on attack, can be ridden and can charge at targets, damaging the first target hit and forcing them to drop any items they are holding.
21291	sDoes low damage on attack, but is capable of holding items and storing a single item within it. It will drop items held in its hands when it recalls, but it will retain the stored item.
21292	sHigh damage resist and medium power attack. Can turn any object, including objects too large to pick up, into a bomb, dealing explosive damage to the next person to touch it. The object will return to normal after the trap is triggered or after a delay.
21293	sCreates sparks on touch and continuously expels a gas of its choice. Automatically extinguishes the user if they catch on fire.
21294	sAttacks will apply crushing gravity to the target. Can target the ground as well to slow targets advancing on you, but you are not immune to your own such effects.
21295	sAttacks apply lightning chains to targets. Has a lightning chain to the user. Lightning chains shock everything near them, doing constant damage.
21296	sCauses you to teleport to it when out of range, unlike other parasites. Has two modes; Combat, where it does and takes medium damage, and Protection, where it does and takes almost no damage but moves slightly slower.
21297	sHas two modes. Ranged; which fires a constant stream of weak, armor-ignoring projectiles. Scout; where it cannot attack, but can move through walls and is quite hard to see. Can lay surveillance snares, which alert it when crossed, in either mode.
21298	sDevastating close combat attacks and high damage resistance. Can smash through weak walls.
21299	sDoes medium damage, but can heal its targets and create beacons to teleport people and things to.
