580	sTeleport to the targeted location.
581	sUse the sword to shear open the flimsy fabric of this reality and teleport to your target.
586	sAllows you to communicate via sign language.
587	sJoin your owner, following them from inside their mind.
588	sHide yourself from your owner's sight.
589	sAllows you to eavesdrop on prayers from the world around you.
590	sSend a psychic message to everyone connected to your Link.
597	sToggles your ability to fold and catch robust paper airplanes.
598	sAnticipate an enemy's attack and strike back with your sheathed blade.
599	sAnticipate an enemy's attack and attempt to strike back, at great risk to yourself. The firing angle requires it be held on your hip.
615	sUnleash the blob!
616	sExit the changeling hivemind permanently. You may still be revived later.
618	sPrepare blood magic by carving runes into your flesh. This is easier with an <b>empowering rune</b>.
619	sFear the Old Blood.
620	sEmpowers your hand to stun and mute a victim on contact. Gets weaker depending on how many have joined the Cult.
