13621	sUnleash the Lionhunter's rifle.<br>The Lionhunter's Rifle is a long ranged ballistic weapon with three shots. These shots function as normal, albeit weak high-caliber munitions when fired from close range or at inanimate objects. You can aim the rifle at distant foes, causing the shot to mark your victim with your grasp and teleport you directly to them.
