18757	sDesigned to tactically reload a NT BR-38 Battle Rifle. Rubber bullets are bouncy and less-than-lethal.
18758	sDesigned to tactically reload a NT BR-38 Battle Rifle. Bullets bounce towards new targets with surprising accuracy and can strike through armored target
