18790	sA high-tech shotgun shell which can be crafted into more advanced shells to produce unique effects. Does nothing on its own.
18791	sA shotgun casing filled with small metal darts. Pokes many tiny holes into meat and kevlar alike. Useful for turning someone's insides into outsides.
18792	sA shotgun casing filled with small plastic darts. That's right, plastic. Do you really think plastic is that scary? Sure, it would hurt to be shot by this, but is it really going to do that much damage? You decide, pal, I'm not your mother. I'm just a computer.
18793	sLooking to stop a riot or put down those damn space hippies in their beat up space caravan? We've got the grenade for you!
