20525	sBathed in soothing darkness, you will slowly heal yourself
20526	sBathed in soothing darkness you will slowly regenerate, even past the point of death. Heightened reflexes will allow you to dodge projectile weapons.
20527	sYou've an item firmly cuffed to your arm. You probably won't be accidentally dropping it somewhere anytime soon.
