24150	sThis is a piece of frightening alien tech that enhances the magnetic pull of atoms in a localized space to temporarily make an object shrink. That or it's just space magic. Either way, it shrinks stuff.
24151	sThis is a piece of frightening alien tech that enhances the magnetic pull of atoms in a localized space to temporarily make an object shrink. That or it's just space magic. Either way, it shrinks stuff, This one is jerry-rigged to work with a non alien cell. It still recharges though.
