27191	sContains dangerous plasma. Do not inhale. Warning: extremely flammable.
27194	sA tank of plasma gas designed specifically for use as internals, particularly for plasma-based lifeforms. If you're not a Plasmaman, you probably shouldn't use this.
27199	sUsed for emergencies. Contains very little oxygen, so try to conserve it until you actually need it.
27203	sUsed for emergencies. Contains very little oxygen with an extra of a funny gas, so try to conserve it until you actually need it.
27209	sA generic tank used for storing and transporting gasses. Can be used for internals.
