27213	sA rapid and safe way to stabilize patients in critical condition for personnel without advanced medical knowledge. Contains a powerful preservative that can delay decomposition when applied to a dead body, and stop the production of histamine during an allergic reaction.
27214	sAn autoinjector containing a stabilized Saturn-X compound. Produced for use in tactical stealth operations, by operatives who were presumably comfortable with nudity.
27215	sA ghetto-looking autoinjector filled with gore, aka dirty kronkaine. You probably shouldn't take this while on the job, but it is a super-stimulant. Don't take two at once.
27216	sA rapid way to stimulate your body's adrenaline, allowing for freer movement in restrictive armor.
27217	sA modified stimulants autoinjector for use in combat situations. Has a mild healing effect.
