27228	sCutting edge bluespace technology allowed Nanotrasen to compact 60u of volume into a single medipen. Contains rare and powerful chemicals used to aid in exploration of very hard environments. This one is purple. WARNING: DO NOT MIX WITH EPINEPHRINE OR ATROPINE.
