19614	sCivilian MODsuits for dignified living.
19615	sPowered suits for protection against low-humor environments.
19616	sMedical MODsuits for quick rescue purposes.
19617	sEngineering suits, for powered engineers.
19618	sSecurity suits for space crime handling.
19619	sMedical MODsuit equipment designed for conducting surgical operations in field conditions.
19620	sAdvanced Engineering suits, for advanced powered engineers.
19621	sModules for MODsuits that require anomaly cores to function.
19622	sEstablishing the bedrock of scientific understanding, paving the way for deeper exploration and theoretical inquiry.
19623	sBasic studies into the mysterious alternate dimension known as bluespace.
19624	sWith a heightened grasp of bluespace dynamics, sophisticated applications and technologies can be devised using data from bluespace crystal analyses.
19625	sFacilitate teleportation methods based on bluespace principles to revolutionize logistical efficiency.
19626	sDelving into the study of mysterious anomalies to investigate methods to refine and harness their unpredictable energies.
19627	sNew shells designed to utilize anomaly cores, maximizing their potential in innovative ways.
19628	sProgrammable machines that make our lives lazier.
19629	sAdapted arcade machines to covertly harness gamers' skills in controlling real drones for practical purposes.
19630	sExploration of AI systems, more intelligent than the entire crew put together.
19631	sDelving into sophisticated AI directives, with hopes that they won't lead to humanity's extinction.
19632	sBallistics can be unpredictable in space.
19633	sAll the essentials to subdue a mime.
19634	sWhen you are on the opposing side of a revolutionary movement.
19635	sFor once, intentional explosions.
19636	sSpecialized bullets designed to ignite, freeze, and inflict various other effects on targets, expanding combat capabilities.
19637	sEnergy-based weaponry designed for both lethal and non-lethal applications.
19638	sSo advanced, even engineers are baffled by its operational principles.
19639	sNanotrasen's finest in ergonomic office tech, ensuring station admin stays productive and compliant with corporate policies — because even in space, paperwork never stops.
19640	sNanotrasen's latest in janitorial tech, making sure the station stays spotless and bear-free.
19641	sUser-friendly consoles for non-technical crew members, enhancing communication and access to essential station information.
19642	sFor the slackers on the station.
19643	sWhen standard-issue tubed food no longer satisfies the station crew's appetite...
19644	sTop-tier kitchen appliances from Nanotrasen, designed to keep the crew well-fed and happy.
19645	sBasic fishing gear tailored for space station environments, perfect for extraterrestrial aquatic pursuits.
19646	sContinuing advancements in fishing technology, incorporating cutting-edge features in space fishing operations. Just don't try this on space carps...
19647	sFish are nice to look at and all, but they can be put to use.
19648	sFor the truly adventurous fisher, these experimental tools could augment your catches in unpredictable ways.
19649	sGrants access to experimental dissections, which allows generation of research points.
19650	sWho would have known being more gentle with a hemostat decreases patient pain?
19651	sWhen simple medicine doesn't cut it.
19652	sWhen evolution isn't fast enough.
19653	sSurgical instruments of dual purpose for quick operations.
19654	sDangerous research used to create dangerous objects.
19655	sBluespace technology using unstable or unbalanced procedures, prone to damaging the fabric of bluespace. Outlawed by galactic conventions.
